Challenge 6 — Leaderboard stretch

Store the top 5 scores in localStorage as an array. Show them on a leaderboard screen accessible from the main menu. Each entry shows rank, moves, time, and date played.

Challenge 7 — Multiplayer (2 players) stretch

Two players take turns. Track each player's matched pairs separately. When a player finds a match they get another turn. When all pairs are found, the player with more matches wins.
